   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The broad strategies include:  1) Advocacy;   2) Research &amp; documentation;  3) Informatics,   4) Networking,   5) Phased interventions 6) Global partnership in development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&quot;Young People&#xB4;s Health and Development&quot; MAMTA-RFSU Network on adolescents sexual and reproductive health and rights in India. The overall goal is to create an enabling environment for improved health and development of young people through an integrated approach to reproductive and and sexual health especially of poorer section by promoting gender equality and rights.</narrative>
